Error [E0978]: the image `i` is built from an unknown system `nope`
 Why: D-JETOS-FREEZE1: `from: system.<name>` is frozen jetos disk-image research; Jetpack's active image path uses `from: packages.<name>`
 Fix: use `from: packages.<name>` for an `.Oci` image, or keep the system image as research capture (no `system.<name>:` contribution is defined)
